      "summaries": {
        "en": "TaxHacker is a self-hosted AI accounting application that automates financial data processing for individuals and small businesses, eliminating manual entry of receipts and invoices. It leverages large language models (LLMs) with customizable prompts to intelligently categorize transactions, extract key details, and handle multi-currency conversions. Users can deploy it locally for privacy, tailor analysis rules to their needs, and integrate it with existing financial workflows to streamline tax preparation and expense tracking.",
        "zh": "TaxHacker是一款自托管的AI会计应用，旨在通过自动化处理收据、发票和交易数据，帮助用户和小型企业简化财务管理工作。它利用大型语言模型的可定制提示功能，智能识别交易类别、提取关键信息并支持多币种换算，其核心设计在于将通用AI能力与具体会计规则灵活结合。用户可本地部署以保障数据隐私，根据自身需求调整分析逻辑，并将其应用于日常记账、税务申报或跨境业务等实际场景，实现高效精准的财务分析。",
        "es": "TaxHacker is a self-hosted AI accounting application that automates financial data processing for individuals and small businesses, eliminating manual entry of receipts and invoices. It leverages large language models (LLMs) with customizable prompts to intelligently categorize transactions, extract key details, and handle multi-currency conversions. Users can deploy it locally for privacy, tailor analysis rules to their needs, and integrate it with existing financial workflows to streamline tax preparation and expense tracking.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "TaxHacker stands out for accounting, ai-analysis, and currency-exchange in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "TaxHacker is a self-hosted AI accounting application that automates financial data processing for individuals and small businesses, eliminating manual entry of receipts and invoices. It leverages large language models (LLMs) with customizable prompts to intelligently categorize transactions, extract key details, and handle multi-currency conversions. Users can deploy it locally for privacy, tailor analysis rules to their needs, and integrate it with existing financial workflows to streamline tax preparation and expense tracking.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/vas3k/TaxHacker for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
