      "summaries": {
        "en": "Skills is a GitHub repository containing a collection of shell scripts and command-line utilities designed to enhance developer productivity through automation. The project organizes practical tools for common development tasks, offering modular scripts that can be easily customized or combined. Developers can integrate these scripts into their workflows to automate repetitive operations, extend functionality by modifying existing scripts, or use them as learning examples for shell programming techniques.",
        "zh": "Skills是一个GitHub仓库，包含一系列用于提升开发效率的Shell脚本和命令行工具集。该项目通过模块化设计将常用开发任务自动化，提供可灵活组合的实用脚本组件。开发者可以将这些脚本集成到日常工作中，自动化重复性操作，或通过修改现有脚本来扩展功能。这些工具既可作为即用型解决方案，也可作为学习Shell编程和自动化实践的参考示例，帮助用户构建个性化的开发工具链。",
        "es": "Skills is a GitHub repository containing a collection of shell scripts and command-line utilities designed to enhance developer productivity through automation. The project organizes practical tools for common development tasks, offering modular scripts that can be easily customized or combined. Developers can integrate these scripts into their workflows to automate repetitive operations, extend functionality by modifying existing scripts, or use them as learning examples for shell programming techniques.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Skills gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
